1 polymer     man 'Leptin receptor'                        22779.152 2   ? 'N668Q, N698Q, N726Q' ? 
;This sequence corresponds to the membrane proximal FnIII module of the mouse leptin receptor (mLEP-R, residues 633 to 827). To facilitate crystallization, three Asn residues were mutated (N668Q, N698Q, N726Q). This FnIII module was co-expressed and co-purified with a His-tagged anti-mLEP-R nanobody (VHH 4.11). Prior to crystallisation experiments, the protein complex was deglycosylated with EndoH. Cys751 of mLEP-R was found to be oxidized and modelled as hydroxycysteine residue (CSO).
;
